%% HelixQA — Autonomous QA Pipeline (Learn → Plan → Execute → Curiosity → Analyze)
%% All navigation is LLM-vision-driven; every phase has a dedicated strategy.

flowchart LR
    start([helixqa autonomous]) --> deploy[Phase 0: Deploy]
    deploy -->|SSH| remote[Ollama + llama.cpp RPC workers]

    deploy --> learn[Phase 1: Learn]
    learn -->|PlanningStrategy| kb[(Knowledge base)]

    learn --> plan[Phase 2: Plan]
    plan -->|PlanningStrategy| tests[(Test cases)]

    plan --> execute[Phase 3: Execute]
    execute -->|NavigationStrategy| screenshots[Screenshots]
    execute --> videos[Video recordings]

    execute --> curiosity[Phase 3.5: Curiosity]
    curiosity -->|NavigationStrategy| explored[(Explored screens)]
    curiosity -->|LLM sees screenshot| action{Next action?}
    action -->|tap/type/DPAD| device[ADB / Playwright / Tauri]
    device -->|UI dump| validate{UI state changed?}
    validate -->|yes| curiosity
    validate -->|no, stuck| stagnation[Report STAGNATION]

    curiosity --> analyze[Phase 4: Analyze]
    analyze -->|AnalysisStrategy| findings[(Findings)]
    analyze --> dedup[FindingsBridge dedup]
    dedup --> tickets[(Issue tickets with evidence)]

    analyze --> report[(pipeline-report.json + cost summary)]

    classDef phase fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#ffc107,color:#000,font-weight:bold
    classDef strat fill:#d1ecf1,stroke:#0c5460,color:#000
    classDef out fill:#d4edda,stroke:#155724,color:#000
    classDef warn fill:#f8d7da,stroke:#721c24,color:#000
    class learn,plan,execute,curiosity,analyze,deploy phase
    class kb,tests,screenshots,videos,explored,findings,tickets,report out
    class stagnation warn
